  "overview": "Google Material Design — Material 3 expressive token system, Roboto Flex typography and tonal purple surfaces",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#fff) canvas paired with `#fff` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#4f378b` with `#ffffff` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Roboto Flex` across 32 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`999px`), cards (`20px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
}
